pkill -f uvicorn
Find the PID using port 8000
Shell
lsof -i :8000

Example output:

Plain Text
COMMAND PID USER
uvicorn 229531 root

Kill that PID:

Shell
kill -9 229531
One-liner to kill whatever is using port 8000
Shell
fuser -k 8000/tcp
Verify port 8000 is free
Shell

==========

cd ~/my-loan-project

source venv/bin/activate

